# Generated / per-deploy secrets — NEVER commit these.
#
# Tailscale-private model (tailscale/):
#   *.env / sesh-root.env : SESH_LEAF_LISTEN + SESH_LEAF_PASSWORD (the leaf
#                           password and tailnet bind). Lives at
#                           /etc/nats/sesh-root.env on the host, chmod 640.
#
# Public-TLS + nsc model (public-tls/):
#   auth.conf  : the operator JWT / system_account / account-resolver block.
#                Public material, but kept out of git; nats-server.conf requires
#                it (fail-closed include), so it is generated per-deploy.
#   *.creds    : nsc-issued leaf credentials (JWT + nkey seed) — secret.
#   tls/       : TLS cert + key for the leafnode listener (cert-manager output).
#   nsc-out/   : bootstrap scratch dir (leaf creds, generated config).
*.env
sesh-root.env
auth.conf
*.creds
tls/
nsc-out/
